{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "spell_resist_total reads the partial resists of a level 60 dummy",
  "contract": "Positive control for spell_resist_total (ADR 0154). A level 60 Templar without beeg spellpen 823764 casts Chastise 803157 (Holy) twelve times at a level 60 dummy (entry 36). CoA.MonsterResistance gives the dummy 60 Holy resistance, a 12% average resist: Unit::CalcAbsorbResist resists 0, 10, 20 or 30% of a hit with probability 0.20, 0.45, 0.30 and 0.05, so a hit is partially resisted with probability 0.8 and all twelve escape with probability 0.2^12, about 4e-9. The resisted total must be positive; a reader that always returned 0 fails.",
